  "about": "Adding a device over the pairing relay (owner rule 2026-10-16: admin devices only; a device without the admin root shows the line in `adminOnlyLine` and never opens a code). The admin device vouches with a flagship/device-admit/v2 admit signed by the account key (IRK), and signs a device grant for the new device's key: a MEMBER grant (memberScopes, signerRoot 'membership', signed by the IRK) or, when it promotes the device to admin, an admin grant (every scope, signerRoot 'admin-root', signed by the admin root, whose seed also rides in `wrappedAdminRoot`). The sealed relay bundle is JSON with exactly the keys in `bundleKeys`; the joining device checks the admit and the grant, signs its encrypted name (flagship/device-profile-self/v1) with its own key, and POSTs /api/users/<u>/devices/admit with exactly the keys in `postKeys`; .com answers 400 'missing device bootstrap' without grant, grantSignature and profile. Grants last 90 days. Scopes sort by their index in DEVICE_SCOPES (scopeOrder), not alphabetically. Seeds are raw Ed25519 seeds.",
